<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram id="p_04_bench_topology" name="04-bench-topology"><mxGraphModel dx="800" dy="600" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1340" pageHeight="860" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="title" value="Two machines: only the real stack runs on the robot; everything that stands in for the world runs on a separate harness machine" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#f5f5f5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="12" width="1300" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="robot" value="ROBOT COMPUTER  -  runs ONLY the real deployed stack (the system under test)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#eef4fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="70" width="560" height="560" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="r_stack" value="Real services (A0-A7):&#10;- camera / depth / VIO&#10;- people perception&#10;- mapping + navigation&#10;- voice (VAD, wake-word)&#10;- VLA + cognition&#10;- middleware router, telemetry" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;fontSize=11;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="120" width="300" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="r_ctrl" value="Whole-body control loop (A4)&#10;MLP policy on ISOLATED cores&#10;50 Hz / 20 ms deadline&#10;(the island the bench tests)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="286" width="300" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="r_obs" value="Observers / probes (B0, B2, B4)&#10;on their OWN dedicated core,&#10;off the application cores,&#10;ready + settled BEFORE t0" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;fontSize=11;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="400" width="300" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="r_clk" value="Clock-sync probe (B2)&#10;SNTP, several times/sec&#10;reports a bounded offset&#10;(illustrative &lt; 0.5 ms)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="512" width="300" height="72" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="r_isl_a" value="ISLAND A&#10;(control + sensor&#10;wire protocols)&#10;&#10;fast bus endpoints,&#10;mic stream,&#10;camera topics" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=center;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#eafaf1;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="410" y="130" width="170" height="200" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="r_isl_b" value="ISLAND B&#10;(bulk feeds +&#10;cloud calls)&#10;&#10;synthetic camera,&#10;bag replay,&#10;cloud-API calls" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=center;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#fdf2f2;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="410" y="400" width="170" height="185" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="harness" value="HARNESS MACHINE  -  stands in for the physical world; its CPU is measured HERE, never counted as stack load" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#fff6ec;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="730" y="70" width="560" height="560" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="h_motor" value="Fake motor boards (C3, A4)&#10;real wire protocol + framing,&#10;real rate (100-1000 Hz)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;fontSize=11;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="120" width="250" height="72" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="h_mic" value="Fake microphone board (C3, A5)&#10;match frames/pkt + packets/msg&#10;(wrong framing biases every consumer)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;fontSize=11;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="204" width="250" height="72" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="h_cam" value="Synthetic camera (C3, A2)&#10;generate frames with N people,&#10;or inject ground-truth detections" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;fontSize=11;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="288" width="250" height="72" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="h_bag" value="Bag replay (C3, A3)&#10;recorded motion drives bursty&#10;mapping; person-data stays local" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;fontSize=11;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="372" width="250" height="64" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="h_stub" value="Cloud-API stubs (C3, A5/A6)&#10;faithful schema + status codes,&#10;LABELLED latency assumption" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;fontSize=11;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="448" width="250" height="72" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="h_obs" value="Harness CPU measured here&#10;(not counted as stack load)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;fontSize=11;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="532" width="250" height="64" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="h_clk" value="Clock-sync peer (B2)&#10;SNTP responder for&#10;the offset bound" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1040" y="532" width="220" height="64" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="link1" value="DEDICATED&#10;low-latency&#10;CONTROL link" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=center;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="210" width="100" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="link2" value="BULK link&#10;(feeds,&#10;replay)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=center;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="460" width="100" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" value="Legend&#10;blue = robot (system under test)   amber = harness machine&#10;green = a faithful fake / stub / synthetic input   purple = observers &amp; harness-CPU accounting&#10;red = the hard control loop + its dedicated link (the thing most at risk)&#10;Two links: a DEDICATED low-latency link for control (so its timing is not stolen) and a BULK link for&#10;feeds; TWO network ISLANDS so a live and a synthetic source sharing a topic name do not collide." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="660" width="620" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="src" value="Source: note C3 (harness, second machine, fake boards + framing fidelity, schema-faithful stubs, synthetic input / detection injection, bag replay, network islands + cut edges). Control loop + isolation: A4. Fake-mic framing + per-message cost: A5. Synthetic N people: A2. Bursty mapping bag replay: A3. Cross-machine clock offset by SNTP, bound &lt; smallest latency: B2 (RFC 4330). Observer core: B0, B4. Rates ILLUSTRATIVE: motor bus 100-1000 Hz [motor_bus_rate_illustrative]; offset &lt; 0.5 ms [clock_offset_target_illustrative]. No measured robot numbers." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=9;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="690" y="660" width="600" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge0" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=0;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;strokeColor=#b85450;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r_isl_a" target="link1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge1" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=0;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.3;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;strokeColor=#b85450;" edge="1" parent="1" source="link1" target="h_motor"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge2" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=0;fontSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r_isl_b" target="link2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge3" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=0;fontSize=10;exitX=1;exitY=0.3;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" edge="1" parent="1" source="link2" target="h_cam"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge4" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=0;fontSize=10;dashed=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;strokeColor=#999999;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r_clk" target="h_clk"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>